; The one variable: a `%Name` claim whose heading reaches into an instance through a
; `%Name` (`parent="Player/%Pivot"`) that a later heading releases. Instantiate seats Hat
; before the release lands (packed_scene.cpp:157-165), so `%Hat` names the SubViewport on
; the sub-scene's Pivot and the quad shows its green sphere.

